# Eng suggestion duty

When fulfilling a large UI/vibe prompt, **proactively suggest** better engineering —
without silently expanding blast radius.

## Surface in the plan (short bullets)

- God-component splits if near size ceilings  
- Reuse shared handicap/financials/report panels  
- Delete retired API clients same day as backend 410  
- Tests: projection helpers, report menu defs, one e2e path  
- Whether ADR / domain rule update is required  

## How to offer refactors

| Situation | Action |
|-----------|--------|
| Required for correctness / render safety | Do in-partition |
| Clarity only | Propose as **optional next phase**; ask first |
| Unrelated cleanup | Do **not** mix into the feature ship |

## Response shape

1. Domain clarifying questions (if any)  
2. Phased plan (types/API → forms → reports → delete legacy → rules)  
3. Eng suggestions labeled **required** vs **optional next**  
4. Implement only agreed / required work  

Never “helpfully” rewrite unrelated workspace modules in the same megaship.
